#: commands/updates/download
msgid ""
"Usage: sudo bresca updates download [--no-tls] [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Downloads the newer BrescaOS version, if there is one, without installing "
"it.\n"
"Install it with 'sudo bresca updates install' before restarting: restarting\n"
"discards it (bootc keeps the downloaded data, so downloading it again is "
"fast).\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --no-tls       Accept a registry allowed without TLS\n"
"  --format=json  Print {downloaded_at, download_only, update_available,\n"
"                 current_version, downloaded_version}, or {downloaded_at,\n"
"                 error}\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help"
msgstr ""
"Uso: sudo bresca updates download [--no-tls] [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Descarga la versión más nueva de BrescaOS, si la hay, sin instalarla.\n"
"Instálala con 'sudo bresca updates install' antes de reiniciar: reiniciar\n"
"la descarta (bootc conserva lo descargado, así que volver a descargarla es "
"rápido).\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  --no-tls       Acepta un registro permitido sin TLS\n"
"  --format=json  Muestra {downloaded_at, download_only, update_available,\n"
"                 current_version, downloaded_version}, o {downloaded_at,\n"
"                 error}\n"
"  -h, --help     Muestra esta ayuda"

#: commands/updates/download
msgid "the download didn't finish: see journalctl -u bresca-updates@download"
msgstr "la descarga no terminó: consulta journalctl -u bresca-updates@download"

#: commands/updates/download
#, sh-printf-format
msgid ""
"Downloaded BrescaOS %s. Install it with 'sudo bresca updates install' before "
"restarting: restarting discards it."
msgstr ""
"BrescaOS %s descargada. Instálala con 'sudo bresca updates install' antes de "
"reiniciar: reiniciar la descarta."

#: commands/updates/download
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "BrescaOS is up to date (%s): nothing to download."
msgstr "BrescaOS está actualizado (%s): no hay nada que descargar."

#: commands/updates/download commands/updates/install
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "couldn't download the update: %s"
msgstr "no se pudo descargar la actualización: %s"

#: commands/updates/install
msgid ""
"Usage: sudo bresca updates install [--download [--no-tls]] [--reboot]\n"
"                                   [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Installs the downloaded BrescaOS version: the next boot uses it. Without\n"
"--download it only installs what 'bresca updates download' downloaded, "
"without\n"
"the network.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --download     Download the newer version first, if there is one\n"
"  --no-tls       With --download, accept a registry allowed without TLS\n"
"  --reboot       Restart after installing\n"
"  --format=json  Print {installed_at, current_version, installed_version}, "
"or\n"
"                 the {..., error} of the download or the install\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help"
msgstr ""
"Uso: sudo bresca updates install [--download [--no-tls]] [--reboot]\n"
"                                 [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Instala la versión descargada de BrescaOS: el próximo arranque la usa. Sin\n"
"--download solo instala lo que descargó 'bresca updates download', sin usar\n"
"la red.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  --download     Descarga antes la versión más nueva, si la hay\n"
"  --no-tls       Con --download, acepta un registro permitido sin TLS\n"
"  --reboot       Reinicia después de instalar\n"
"  --format=json  Muestra {installed_at, current_version, installed_version}, "
"o\n"
"                 el {..., error} de la descarga o de la instalación\n"
"  -h, --help     Muestra esta ayuda"

#: commands/updates/install
#, sh-printf-format
